<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Comerci downgraded to sell.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Comerci downgraded to sell.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokerage Abaco-Rodman downgraded Monday Mexican retailer Controladora Comercial Mexicana (Comerci) to sell from buy.</p>
<p>&quot;As a result of the recent announcements regarding the acquisition of Kmart (Corp ) stores and the termination of its joint venture with Auchan, we have changed our recommendation on Comerci from buy to sell,&quot; the brokerage said in a report.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7287902))</p>
